SKILL calibrate-plant  v1
Turn the plant model from UNCALIBRATED into evidence.

1. On the bench, record a step response of the real device: apply a fixed output, log
   temperature every tick until it settles. Keep the raw file under models/.
2. Fit TAU_S, GAIN_C and AMBIENT_C to the measurement.
3. Set CALIBRATION in the model file to the measurement file name.
4. Set CALIBRATION required in profile.cfg so an uncalibrated model can no longer pass.
5. Run kindgleam verify and record the fit:
   kindgleam memory add facts <source> "thermal model fitted: tau ..., gain ..., error ..."
